  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(512)/(8)times((2401)/(49)-(88)/(11))+(2197)/(169)\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nPerform simplifications for fractions and arithmetic operations.\n\n**Calculations:**\n\n(512)/(8) = 64\n\n(2401)/(49) = 49\n\n(88)/(11) = 8\n\n⇒ (49 - 8) = 41\n\n⇒ 64 times 41 = 2624\n\n(2197)/(169) = 13\n\n⇒ (2624 + 13) = 2637\n\n**∴ The value is 2637.**",
